{"ok": false, "issues": ["The new-construction exemption in coverage_logic is missing the mobilehome carve-out. SDMC 98.0703(k) exempts 'housing that has been issued a certificate of occupancy within the previous 15 years, unless the housing is a mobilehome', so a mobilehome with a recent certificate of occupancy is still covered.", "coverage_logic leaves out the 98.0703(l) exemption. It covers separately alienable property (single-family, condo or mobilehome) where the landlord is not a REIT, a corporation, an LLC with a corporate member, or mobilehome park management. Added it the same way the sibling Cal. Civ. Code § 1946.2 record encodes it: owner_type natural_person.", "The required written exemption notice to tenants cannot be encoded, so the (l) exemption should also be described in the exemptions text. That field is outside the fixable fields: please update it manually."], "fix": {"coverage_logic": {"covers": null, "exempt": {"any": [{"all": [{"field": "certificate_of_occupancy", "op": ">", "value": {"as_of_minus_years": 15}}, {"field": "property_type", "op": "!=", "value": "mobile_home"}]}, {"all": [{"field": "property_type", "op": "==", "value": "duplex"}, {"field": "owner_occupied", "op": "==", "value": true}]}, {"all": [{"field": "property_type", "op": "==", "value": "single_family"}, {"field": "owner_occupied", "op": "==", "value": true}]}, {"all": [{"field": "property_type", "op": "in", "value": ["single_family", "condo", "mobile_home"]}, {"field": "owner_type", "op": "==", "value": "natural_person"}]}]}}}}
